 the predictive power. Our results can help review aggregation platforms to determine mechanisms to cut down the bias on their platforms and can benefit businesses and consumers on their platform to access a fairer metric for service quality.","topics":[],"score":2175,"global_rank":221278},{"name":"IsaiahTT/Challenge_7","owner":"IsaiahTT","html_url":"https://github.com/IsaiahTT/Challenge_7","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2175,"global_rank":221304},{"name":"anupamshandilya92/large-language-models","owner":"anupamshandilya92","html_url":"https://github.com/anupamshandilya92/large-language-models","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"A repository of notebooks covering recently developed topics and methods in Large Language Models","topics":[],"score":2175,"global_rank":221359},{"name":"AchalSuresh/Melanoma-Image-Classificaiton-Algorithm","owner":"AchalSuresh","html_url":"https://github.com/AchalSuresh/Melanoma-Image-Classificaiton-Algorithm","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"The project aims to build a ML Image classification Algorithm that can classify Malignant and Benign skin cancer cells images ","topics":[],"score":2175,"global_rank":221394},{"name":"reeya26/Predicting_Web_Traffic","owner":"reeya26","html_url":"https://github.com/reeya26/Predicting_Web_Traffic","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Predicting the daily users visiting Wikipedia pages","topics":[],"score":2175,"global_rank":221401},{"name":"eannefawcett/Testing","owner":"eannefawcett","html_url":"https://github.com/eannefawcett/Testing","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2175,"global_rank":221420},{"name":"jkcm/uw-mcb","owner":"jkcm","html_url":"https://github.com/jkcm/uw-mcb","stars":0,